  data: {
    LLM: "Statistically, the 'Banker' bet has the lowest house edge (~1.06%) even with the 5% commission. Avoid the 'Tie' bet, as the house edge is extremely high (~14%).\n\nHand tracking (Scorecards): Many players look for 'trends' or streaks (e.g., 'Dragon' runs), though Baccarat is mathematically a game of independent events.\n\nBankroll management: Effective Baccarat play is about disciplined wagering and knowing when to walk away during a winning streak.",
